WEBVTT

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.169
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.344
Can I help you, sir?

00:00:21.638 --> 00:00:24.182
No, I was just-- I was just waiting.

00:00:34.985 --> 00:00:35.986
Hi.

00:00:38.113 --> 00:00:39.364
(SIGHS) What brings you here?

00:00:40.323 --> 00:00:41.575
Same as you.

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.536
You're here to get a loan
to open up a bakery?

00:00:44.703 --> 00:00:45.871
Yes.

00:00:47.372 --> 00:00:48.874
What are the odds of that?

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:54.546
-Well, may the best man win, I guess.
-Excuse me.

00:00:56.298 --> 00:00:58.592
Hey! Hey, mister!

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:00.135
Hey, mister.

00:01:01.636 --> 00:01:02.679
Hey, fella.

00:01:02.846 --> 00:01:05.557
Mr. Kowalski,
Mr. Bingley will see you now.

00:01:07.058 --> 00:01:08.059
Okay.

00:01:09.728 --> 00:01:10.729
(EXHALES) Okay.

00:01:10.896 --> 00:01:11.897
(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:26.494
J. KOWALSKI
FANCY CONFECTIONS BAKED GOODS

00:01:29.497 --> 00:01:31.666
(EGG RATTLING)

00:01:34.669 --> 00:01:36.129
MR. BINGLEY: You're currently working

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:39.674
in a canning factory.

00:01:39.841 --> 00:01:43.428
That's the best I can do.
I only got back in, uh, '24.

00:01:43.929 --> 00:01:46.806
-Got back?
-From Europe, sir.

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:50.018
Yeah. I was part
of the expeditionary forces there.

00:02:00.445 --> 00:02:01.947
(COINS CLINKING)

00:02:02.781 --> 00:02:04.532
(SNIFFING)

00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:15.085
(BARKS)

00:02:15.252 --> 00:02:16.294
(GASPS)

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:23.969
-All right.
-MR. BINGLEY: Mr. Kowalski--

00:02:24.803 --> 00:02:27.097
You gotta try the paczkis, okay?

00:02:27.806 --> 00:02:30.725
It's my grandmother's recipe.
The orange zest just--

00:02:30.892 --> 00:02:31.977
-(SIGHS HAPPILY)
-MR. BINGLEY: Mr. Kowalski.

00:02:32.769 --> 00:02:36.481
What do you propose
to offer the bank as collateral?

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:38.441
Collateral?

00:02:38.775 --> 00:02:40.110
Collateral.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.446
There are machines now

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:47.284
that can produce hundreds
of donuts an hour.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:49.661
I know. I know. But they're nothing
like what I can do. You--

00:02:49.828 --> 00:02:52.163
The bank must be protected, Mr. Kowalski.

00:02:53.623 --> 00:02:54.833
Good day to you.

00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:56.167
(BELL DINGS)

00:03:04.301 --> 00:03:05.844
(EGG CRACKING)

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:18.023
Hey! Mr. English Guy!

00:03:18.356 --> 00:03:19.816
I think your egg is hatching.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:21.234
(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)

00:03:32.162 --> 00:03:34.664
-(GASPS) What just happened?
-(SHUSHES)

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.207
(CHIRPING)

00:03:46.051 --> 00:03:47.594
(JACOB STAMMERS)

00:03:49.054 --> 00:03:50.722
But, excuse me?

00:03:54.392 --> 00:03:55.393
(EXHALES SHARPLY)

00:03:55.852 --> 00:03:58.897
I was over there. Came over...

00:03:59.064 --> 00:04:00.690
I was over there.

00:04:04.194 --> 00:04:06.237
-In you hop.
-JACOB: Hello?

00:04:06.571 --> 00:04:07.697
-(CREATURES SQUAWKING)
-NEWT: No.

00:04:07.864 --> 00:04:09.115
Everyone settle down.

00:04:10.533 --> 00:04:12.077
Stay. Dougal, don't make me come in there.

00:04:13.745 --> 00:04:15.372
Don't make me come down there.

00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:20.210
Absolutely not.

00:04:21.086 --> 00:04:22.295
Alohomora.

00:04:25.256 --> 00:04:28.051
Oh, so you're gonna steal the money, huh?

00:04:29.511 --> 00:04:30.929
-(ALARM BLARING)
-Petrificus Totalus.

00:04:33.848 --> 00:04:34.933
Mr. Bingley!

00:04:37.394 --> 00:04:39.396
Kowalski.

00:04:43.108 --> 00:04:44.109
(SIGHS)

00:04:44.484 --> 00:04:45.610
Really?

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:02.335
No. Don't play that.

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:04.754
-(CHITTERING)
-Look.

00:05:07.465 --> 00:05:08.633
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

00:05:09.592 --> 00:05:10.593
Oh, no.

00:05:11.052 --> 00:05:13.138
No, no, no. Don't-- Don't shoot.

00:05:13.388 --> 00:05:14.973
Don't shoot! (SCREAMS)

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.600
NEWT: Right. For the last time,
you pilfering pest,

00:05:18.017 --> 00:05:20.645
paws off what doesn't belong to you.

00:05:20.812 --> 00:05:22.021
MAN: Someone's robbing the bank!

00:05:22.188 --> 00:05:23.815
Awfully sorry about that.

00:05:23.982 --> 00:05:25.984
-(PEOPLE SHOUTING)
-(WHISTLE BLOWING)

00:05:26.151 --> 00:05:27.152
What the hell was that?

00:05:27.735 --> 00:05:29.112
NEWT: Nothing that need concern you.

00:05:29.487 --> 00:05:32.907
Now, unfortunately,
you have seen far too much.

00:05:33.074 --> 00:05:34.784
If you wouldn't mind,
if you just stand there,

00:05:34.951 --> 00:05:36.494
this'll be over in a jiffy.

00:05:36.661 --> 00:05:37.745
Mmm-hmm. Sure. Yeah.

00:05:38.037 --> 00:05:39.038
(GRUNTS)

00:05:40.874 --> 00:05:41.916
-Sorry.
-(PANTING)

00:05:46.004 --> 00:05:47.005
Bugger.

